    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965380/extras/71d4923560590040711992068418e275.avif?t=1733951836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crazy Tanks is a Free to play game, Inspired from old schools tank games where you fight in a Free For all Round with up to 10 players to see who is the best one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Crazy Tanks Bullets Bounce of walls, maps have movable crates, and there are Heal and shield Power-Ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also Customize your Tank and Bullets with several skin that you can get just by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feedback is always welcome! Come have fun! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965380/extras/71d4923560590040711992068418e275.avif?t=1733951836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crazy Tanks is a Free to play game, Inspired from old schools tank games where you fight in a Free For all Round with up to 10 players to see who is the best one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Crazy Tanks Bullets Bounce of walls, maps have movable crates, and there are Heal and shield Power-Ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also Customize your Tank and Bullets with several skin that you can get just by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feedback is always welcome! Come have fun! </p>",
